ec-fea1-47b7-b6d4-44fbef3b6511?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=7470bc00530a2df84281126c55d8a5e0, https://si.imgix.net/0d6e5bbc/uploads/origins/be8be0ec-fea1-47b7-b6d4-44fbef3b6511?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b8ce189e0279ee08be9c88e64f4b45f1 2x, https://si.imgix.net/0d6e5bbc/uploads/origins/be8be0ec-fea1-47b7-b6d4-44fbef3b6511?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8062ca166c1abb0c624ad0426b5a999f 3x"}, "body": "Hello, it's nice to meet you, I saw your illustration on my homepage and I really like your artstyle. I was hoping you can draw my character: she is a moth and a nun. You can choose whichever hairstyle, expression or pose that you would like! For some ideas: her favourite hobby is reading, but she also likes to drink a lot of wine, go stargazing and watch meteor showers, pray, write stories (with pen and paper because she is very old-fashioned and doesn't own technology). Please feel free to choose something else though, as long as it isn't related to using technology, it will be fine! She is nocturnal and usually does all of her activities by candlelight. She lives in an old library which is inside an abandoned monastery, and her only friend is her rabbit companion which you can see on her reference sheet. Please also note that when she is high-energy, she has sparkles in her eyes and the moon on her forehead is yellow, but when she is calm or low energy, the moon on her forehead is purple and she does not have the stars in her eyes, like on the left side of her reference sheet. I really hope you consider my request, your art is so beautiful. Thank you very much!\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/file/d/1rBWmLHxTLaA1Tq54II6FCS6OxUU9sfjG/view?usp=sharing", "nc": 129, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@yyy_sketch/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 4018918, "client_id": 2231946, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3ebd75fe/uploads/origins/9741af29-245e-4afe-8ec6-d7bdb2ec6a80?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=37e2eb897d3bc4623cc36c60b1c1f58d", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3ebd75fe/uploads/origins/9741af29-245e-4afe-8ec6-d7bdb2ec6a80?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=37e2eb897d3bc4623cc36c60b1c1f58d, https://si.imgix.net/3ebd75fe/uploads/origins/9741af29-245e-4afe-8ec6-d7bdb2ec6a80?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2e9c18edfec148bf9415c0dd9f07d111 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3ebd75fe/uploads/origins/9741af29-245e-4afe-8ec6-d7bdb2ec6a80?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=4f414783363e0bcebd333167447b82a6 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/3ebd75fe/uploads/origins/9741af29-245e-4afe-8ec6-d7bdb2ec6a80?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=44c01124734cb0dd5c284240dc343366", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/3ebd75fe/uploads/origins/9741af29-245e-4afe-8ec6-d7bdb2ec6a80?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=44c01124734cb0dd5c284240dc343366, https://si.imgix.net/3ebd75fe/uploads/origins/9741af29-245e-4afe-8ec6-d7bdb2ec6a80?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=27302e29353a62ebd5a85c775ec94a35 2x, https://si.imgix.net/3ebd75fe/uploads/origins/9741af29-245e-4afe-8ec6-d7bdb2ec6a80?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=5d446cf0cbb642c1e10074ba8a7edc68 3x"}, "body": "はじめまして、新着作品一覧から過去作品に惹かれてきました\nもしよろしければリクエストを受けていただけないでしょうか\nサービス終了したネットゲームのマイキャラクターがモデルのうちの子になります\n\n・希望する内容を箇条書きで\nお淑やかで献身的、大人しめな性格の子です\n「依頼衣装」とついているファイルの衣装いずれかを着せてあげてください\n（もしくは「その他衣装」から飛べるフォルダの中にお好みの衣装があれば、そちらを着せてあげてください）\nゲーム内モデルでは胸が大きいですが、控えめにアレンジをお願いします（Bカップ程度～つるぺたまでお好みで）\n耳と尻尾は付けてあげてください\n表情・仕草・ポーズについてはお任せします\n見た目からのイメージで描いていただければと思います\n\nご検討をお願いします\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1gXZVDfcsl66QZ8VxPLKFXERqQXKioNsJ", "nc": 17, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@yyy_sketch/works/1", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": false, "creator_id": 4018918, "client_id": 3627599, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/80d2fcc6/uploads/origins/dce00eac-9ea3-43e5-8d7d-c88b3cf48778?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ed0408265aaee0703eb3efc2a0ee3ccf", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/80d2fcc6/uploads/origins/dce00eac-9ea3-43e5-8d7d-c88b3cf48778?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ed0408265aaee0703eb3efc2a0ee3ccf, https://si.imgix.net/80d2fcc6/uploads/origins/dce00eac-9ea3-43e5-8d7d-c88b3cf48778?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=1d4ac9ad1f5855b40d3589a5b4c8e7df 2x, https://si.imgix.net/80d2fcc6/uploads/origins/dce00eac-9ea3-43e5-8d7d-c88b3cf48778?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=89d4ac26745873d155994befb0722497 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/80d2fcc6/uploads/origins/dce00eac-9ea3-43e5-8d7d-c88b3cf48778?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f2e4063234b8741110c2e330e913a583", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/80d2fcc6/uploads/origins/dce00eac-9ea3-43e5-8d7d-c88b3cf48778?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=f2e4063234b8741110c2e330e913a583, https://si.imgix.net/80d2fcc6/uploads/origins/dce00eac-9ea3-43e5-8d7d-c88b3cf48778?b